# Ponytail (disabled)

This file is kept as a backup of the compact rule. Active Ponytail is via:

- `.cursor/hooks.json` (default level `full`; message `/ponytail lite|full|ultra|off`)
- `.agents/skills/ponytail*` (audit, review, debt, gain, help)

Do not set `alwaysApply: true` on this file while hooks are installed.
